{"ticker":"AKAM","updated":"2026-11-13T22:36:54Z","profile":{"longName":"Akamai Technologies, Inc.","shortName":"Akamai Technologies, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","country":"United States","website":"https://www.akamai.com","fullTimeEmployees":11832,"marketCap":12317170688,"trailingPE":33.229572,"forwardPE":12.328267,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.8056283,"pegRatio":0.97,"targetMeanPrice":130.39095,"targetHighPrice":225.0,"targetLowPrice":73.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.064,"earningsGrowth":-0.206,"grossMargins":0.56393003,"operatingMargins":0.104899995,"profitMargins":0.088360004,"totalRevenue":4390164992,"beta":0.664,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":165.45,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":77.37,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Akamai Technologies, Inc. engages in the provision of security, delivery, and cloud computing solutions in the United States and internationally. It offers security solutions that include web application and application programming interfaces (API) protection solutions, which protect web, API, and mobile app traffic from attacks; Bot & Abuse portfolio, which provides solutions to help customers protect against threats; full account lifecycle protections including the ability to defend against account takeover and opening abuse, adversarial bot protection, protection against credential stuffing, inventory scalping, and hoarding; and solutions designed to stop persistent scrapers from stealing content; API security, which discovers, audits, and monitors API; and microservice and application component protection that analyzes and protects application traffic that moves between application components. The company also offers cloud computing services, which include compute, storage, and cloud native and networking services; and Akamai App Platform, provides ready-to-run templates that address challenges in deploying, managing and scaling Kubernetes clusters at scale. In addition, it offers delivery solutions that include web and mobile performance solutions, which enables dynamic websites and applications, as well as global traffic management, site acceleration, application load bal","summary_zh":"Akamai Technologies, Inc. 在美國和國際範圍內提供安全、交付和雲端運算解決方案。它提供的安全解决方案包括 Web 应用程序和应用程序编程接口 (API) 保护解决方案，可保护 Web、API 和移动应用程序流量免受攻击； Bot & Abuse 产品组合，提供帮助客户防范威胁的解决方案；完整的帐户生命周期保护，包括防御帐户接管和开放滥用、对抗性机器人保护、防止撞库、库存倒卖和囤积的能力；以及旨在阻止持久性抓取工具窃取内容的解决方案； API安全，发现、审核和监控API；微服务和应用程序组件保护，用于分析和保护在应用程序组件之间移动的应用程序流量。该公司还提供云计算服务，包括计算、存储、云原生和网络服务；和 Akamai 应用平台，提供可立即运行的模板，解决大规模部署、管理和扩展 Kubernetes 集群的挑战。此外，它还提供交付解决方案，包括网络和移动性能解决方案，支持动态网站和应用程序，以及全球流量管理、网站加速、应用程序负载平衡","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 基礎設施","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":76.87,"h":77.95,"l":75.59,"c":76.46,"v":1604000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":76.57,"h":76.9,"l":75.68,"c":76.38,"v":1188700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":76.57,"h":77.22,"l":74.89,"c":75.84,"v":1941000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":76.03,"h":77.3,"l":75.94,"c":77.09,"v":1553700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":77.62,"h":77.62,"l":76.02,"c":76.28,"v":7140500},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":76.98,"h":76.98,"l":76.01,"c":76.68,"v":1350300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":76.7,"h":76.75,"l":75.05,"c":75.27,"v":1660200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":75.41,"h":76.28,"l":74.95,"c":76.23,"v":1464000},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":75.89,"h":76.0,"l":74.93,"c":75.38,"v":1243700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":75.38,"h":76.12,"l":75.19,"c":76.05,"v":1610200},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":76.46,"h":76.85,"l":75.77,"c":76.23,"v":1164200},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":76.12,"h":76.38,"l":74.72,"c":75.76,"v":1633200},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":75.56,"h":76.12,"l":74.56,"c":75.84,"v":1480300},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":76.17,"h":78.16,"l":75.6,"c":78.01,"v":1634500},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":78.01,"h":79.0,"l":77.43,"c":77.56,"v":1314000},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":78.0,"h":78.56,"l":77.07,"c":78.44,"v":1264200},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":78.62,"h":78.92,"l":76.41,"c":76.6,"v":1299600},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":76.8,"h":77.62,"l":76.